# Python 3.9 dev/test tooling for the ci.yml python job.
#
# Split from ci-dev-py3.in because pytest and iniconfig both dropped Python 3.9
# (pytest >= 9.0 and iniconfig >= 2.3 declare requires-python >= 3.10), so a
# single resolution cannot serve the whole 3.9 - 3.13 matrix. Resolving against
# 3.9 picks the last releases that still ship for it.
#
# Locked output: ci-dev-py39.txt. Refresh via scripts/update-lockfiles.sh.
maturin
pytest
